# Careers form — automatic email sending (Web3Forms)
#
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com
# 2. Enter the inbox that should receive applications: extraclub.az@gmail.com
# 3. Copy the Access Key they email you and paste it below.
# 4. Redeploy. Applications (and the attached CV) are then emailed automatically.
#
# Until this is set, the form gracefully falls back to opening the visitor's mail app.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=YOUR_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY
